---
title: Deployment lifecycle
---
stateDiagram-v2
    accTitle: Deployment lifecycle
    accDescr: A deployment moves from queued to building to canary. Canary either promotes to live or rolls back. Rollback and build failure both end in failed.

    [*] --> Queued
    Queued --> Building : runner picks up
    Building --> Failed : build error
    Building --> Canary : image pushed
    Canary --> Live : error rate under 1% for 10 min
    Canary --> RollingBack : error rate spike
    RollingBack --> Failed
    Live --> [*]
    Failed --> [*]

    note right of Canary
        The only state that can
        move backwards.
    end note
